# =============================================================================
# LineagePhenotyping .gitignore
#
# Philosophy:
#   - source code, reference data, docs, and per-dataset configs are tracked.
#   - generated outputs (plots, run logs, intermediate CSVs/TSVs that the
#     pipeline produces from inputs) are not.
#   - personal scratch (debug scripts, one-off plots, test wrappers) lives in
#     scratch/ and is ignored entirely.
#
# Tracked example data lives under three subdirectories that already exist
# upstream (data/, die-1/, ceh-32_mutant/). Only inputs there should be
# committed; generated outputs in those subdirs are still ignored by the
# patterns below.
# =============================================================================

# ---- generated binary outputs --------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.png
*.html

# ---- run logs and temp output --------------------------------------------
run_log_*.txt
Rplots.pdf
benchmark_output.txt
*_WT_stats.pdf

# ---- editor / OS cruft ---------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.R~
*.sh~
*.txt~
\#*\#
.#*
*.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# ---- personal scratch (debug, one-off, test, dataset-specific wrappers) --
scratch/

# ---- large data archives (kept locally, not in git) ----------------------
*.zip
